{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dive into a colorful, retro-inspired adventure, and navigate vibrant mazes packed with clever challenges, traps, hidden secrets, and quirky characters. <i>Wormstep</i> combines the classic <i>Sokoban</i> puzzle gameplay with <i>Snake</i> - and adds a good couple of fun surprises to it as well!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3364640/extras/skulls.gif?t=1734010638\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Vibrant, retro style pixel art graphics</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Challenging puzzles, puzzling challenges</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Interactive and dynamic environments</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Both friendly and hostile characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hidden areas and secret levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Customly created levels can be played</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3364640/extras/store_page_img.png?t=1734010638\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The demo version includes a 31 levels </strong>(15-30 minutes)<strong> long single player campaign difficulty wise ranging from easy to fairly challenging.  Using any type of text editor, players can create their own campaigns though - </strong><strong><i>even for the demo!</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">From solving simple navigation and sokoban type puzzles to complex challenges combining traps, switches, locked doors and avoiding enemies - the demo version of Wormstep introduces the player to many fun gameplay mechanics.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Demo Completed","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3364640/c856b77fa